     1	"""Pluggable LLM backends.
     2	
     3	Two implementations of the same interface:
     4	
     5	- ``OpenAIChatLLM``: any OpenAI-compatible chat endpoint (set LLM_API_KEY,
     6	  LLM_BASE_URL, LLM_MODEL). Used for brainstorming, criteria writing,
     7	  MATCH judging, report writing, table extraction and follow-up Q&A.
     8	- ``GeminiConnectorLLM``: Gemini through the registered custom.gemini
     9	  connector (set DLS_LLM_BACKEND=gemini-connector). The API key lives in
    10	  the connector's secure storage and is never present in this process;
    11	  each call goes through the connector helper, which attaches a
    12	  surrogate credential that is swapped for the real key on egress.
    13	- ``HeuristicLLM``: deterministic offline fallback (lexical scoring,
    14	  extractive report assembly). Lets the whole pipeline run — and be
    15	  tested — with no API key at all.
    16	
    17	Every method degrades to the heuristic behavior on API errors, so a flaky
    18	endpoint never kills a search run.
    19	"""
