    29	
    30	  <!-- Center: results -->
    31	  <main class="main">
    32	    <div id="welcome" class="welcome">
    33	      <h2>输入一个研究问题，剩下的交给它</h2>
    34	      <p>系统会先澄清问题、生成检索标准，然后跨 Semantic Scholar / OpenAlex / Crossref
    35	         检索，逐篇打分，并顺着引用关系网扩展，最后给出带引用的论文集。</p>
    36	      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('btn-new-search').click()">开始一次新检索</button>
    37	    </div>
    38	
    39	    <div id="search-detail" class="hidden">
    40	      <div class="detail-head">
    41	        <h2 id="detail-question"></h2>
    42	        <div id="detail-meta" class="detail-meta"></div>
    43	        <div id="detail-criteria" class="criteria-chips"></div>
    44	        <div class="detail-actions">
    45	          <button id="btn-report" class="btn btn-primary">生成报告</button>
    46	          <button id="btn-extract" class="btn">抽取对比表</button>
    47	          <button id="btn-updates" class="btn">检查新论文</button>
    48	          <span class="export-group">
    49	            <button class="btn" data-export="csv">导出 CSV</button>
    50	            <button class="btn" data-export="bibtex">BibTeX</button>
    51	            <button class="btn" data-export="ris">RIS</button>
    52	          </span>
    53	        </div>
    54	      </div>
    55	      <table class="papers-table">
    56	        <thead>
    57	          <tr><th class="col-match">MATCH</th><th>论文</th><th class="col-cit">引用/年</th><th class="col-star"></th></tr>
    58	        </thead>
    59	        <tbody id="papers-body"></tbody>
    60	      </table>
    61	      <div id="papers-empty" class="empty hidden">这个检索还没有入选论文。</div>
    62	    </div>
    63	
    64	    <div id="library-view" class="hidden">
    65	      <div class="detail-head">
    66	        <h2>论文库</h2>
    67	        <div class="detail-meta"><span id="library-count"></span>
    68	          <label class="star-filter"><input type="checkbox" id="chk-starred"> 只看收藏 ★</label>
    69	        </div>
    70	      </div>
    71	      <table class="papers-table">
    72	        <thead><tr><th class="col-match">KEY</th><th>论文</th><th class="col-cit">引用/年</th><th class="col-star"></th></tr></thead>
    73	        <tbody id="library-body"></tbody>
    74	      </table>
    75	    </div>
    76	  </main>
    77	
    78	  <!-- Right: inspector tabs -->
    79	  <aside class="inspector">
    80	    <div class="tabs">
    81	      <button class="tab active" data-tab="progress">进度</button>
    82	      <button class="tab" data-tab="report">报告</button>
    83	      <button class="tab" data-tab="table">表格</button>
    84	      <button class="tab" data-tab="ask">问答</button>
    85	    </div>
    86	    <div id="tab-progress" class="tab-page">
    87	      <div id="job-log" class="job-log"><p class="muted">暂无运行中的任务。发起检索、报告或抽取后，这里会实时显示进度。</p></div>
    88	    </div>
    89	    <div id="tab-report" class="tab-page hidden">
