    91	    </div>
    92	    <div id="tab-table" class="tab-page hidden">
    93	      <div id="extract-bar" class="extract-bar hidden">
    94	        <input id="extract-columns" type="text" placeholder="列名，逗号分隔：paper, year, method, dataset">
    95	        <button id="btn-do-extract" class="btn btn-primary">抽取</button>
    96	      </div>
    97	      <div id="table-view" class="markdown"><p class="muted">还没有表格。点「抽取对比表」并指定列名。</p></div>
    98	    </div>
    99	    <div id="tab-ask" class="tab-page hidden">
   100	      <div id="ask-log" class="ask-log"><p class="muted">基于当前检索的入选论文提问，例如：哪些用了表格画像？</p></div>
   101	      <div class="ask-bar">
   102	        <input id="ask-input" type="text" placeholder="输入问题，回车发送">
